#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:42
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:56
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter deinterlaces input video by applying Donald Graft’s "
"adaptive kernel deinterlacing. It works on interlaced parts of a video to "
"produce progressive frames."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter deriadkuje vstupné video aplikovaním adaptívneho "
"jadrového deriadkovania Donalda Grafta. Pracuje na preriadkovaných častiach "
"videa a produkuje progresívne snímky."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:47
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:54
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:55
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:57
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "Prah"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:58
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:59
msgid ""
"Sets the threshold which affects the filter's tolerance when determining if "
"a pixel line must be processed. It must be an integer in the range [0,255] "
"and defaults to 10. A value of 0 will result in applying the process on "
"every pixel."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví prah, ktorý ovplyvňuje toleranciu filtra pri určovaní, či sa musí "
"spracovať riadok pixelov. Musí to byť celé číslo v rozsahu [0, 255], "
"predvolená hodnota je 10. Hodnota 0 spôsobí aplikovanie procesu na každý "
"pixel."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:60
msgid "Paint in white pixels exceeding the threshold"
msgstr "Vyfarbiť biele pixely prekračujúce prah"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:61
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:64
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:67
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:70
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Prepnúť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:62
msgid ""
"Paint pixels exceeding the threshold value to white if set to **On**. "
"Default is **Off**."
msgstr ""
"Ak je nastavené na **Zapnuté**, nafarbi pixely presahujúce hodnotu prahu na "
"bielo. Predvolené je **Vypnuté**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:63
msgid "Swap fields"
msgstr "Zobraziť  vodiace linky"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:65
msgid ""
"Sets the fields order. Swap fields if set to **On**, leave fields alone if "
"**Off**. Default is **Off**."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví poradie polí. Ak je nastavené na **Zapnuté**, zamení polia; ak "
"**Vypnuté**, polia ponechá. Predvolené je **Vypnuté**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:66
msgid "Enable additional sharpening"
msgstr "Povoliť Audio Spectrum"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:68
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:71
msgid "Default is **Off**"
msgstr "Predvolené je **Vypnuté**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/kernel_deinterlacer.rst:69
msgid "Enable two-way sharpening"
msgstr "Povoliť Audio Spectrum"

